  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a shallow bowl, combine Mediterranean seasoning with one-step coater.\n• Dip chicken into crumb mixture to coat, pressing the crumbs on so they stick. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd220a8b4d4424a20898fe-bb7ce990.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd220a8b4d4424a20898fe-60d43079.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, trim and halve pea pods lengthways. Using a vegetable peeler, peel carrot into ribbons.\n• In a large bowl, combine pea pods, carrot, spinach and rocket mix, fetta cubes and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd220a8b4d4424a20898fe-15be9a1a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice plant-based crumbed chicken.\n• Divide pea pod salad and Mediterranean plant-based crumbed chicken between plates.\n• Drizzle over creamy pesto dressing to serve. Enjoy",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd220a8b4d4424a20898fe-1dec7488.jpeg"
    }
  ]
